    "title": "West Fargo announces road closures and detours for 9th Street corridor reconstruction project - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Judith Jackson ,\n6 hours ago West Fargo, North Dakota – Drivers in West Fargo should prepare for changes in their daily routes as a key intersection and surrounding roads are set to close for construction. City officials announced that beginning Monday, April 27, the intersection of 12th Avenue North and 9th Street Northeast, including the roundabout, will be shut down as part of the larger 9th Street NE corridor reconstruction project. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
